OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute to 'kind and  
OL,4,Aloving' mechanic                       
OL,6,FThe family of a 20-year-old man who    
OL,7,Fdied in a car crash have paid tribute  
OL,8,Fto the apprentice mechanic saying he   
OL,9,F"brought so much happiness to the lives
OL,10,Fof those around him".                  
OL,12,FJacob Moody from Newquay died after his
OL,13,Fcar hit a fallen tree on the A39 near  
OL,14,FSt Kew at about 01:55 GMT on Saturday. 
OL,16,FHis family described him as "a kind,   
OL,17,Floving, generous, intelligent and      
OL,18,Ffun-loving young man with a wonderful  
OL,19,Fsense of humour".                      
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
