OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute to 'kind and  
OL,4,Aloving' mechanic                       
OL,6,F"His sudden and tragic death has left  
OL,7,Feveryone who knew and loved him utterly
OL,8,Fdevastated. He will be missed more than
OL,9,Fwords can ever express," they added.   
